  "  <script type=\"application/json\" id=\"map-words\">{\"base_failed\": \"Data unavailable. The map\\u0027s details could not be loaded in this update; that is not the same as no hail, no landmarks and no base map. This is not an all-clear.\", \"forecast_reason\": \"model forecast: {detail}\", \"held\": \"Held\", \"list_and\": \" and \", \"list_comma\": \", \", \"list_last\": \", and \", \"no_layer_picture\": \"No {layer} picture in this update. This is not an all-clear.\", \"no_layer_pictures\": \"No {layer} pictures in this update{why}. This is not an all-clear.\", \"no_reports\": \"No reports. \", \"nothing_to_show\": \"Nothing to show for {layer}\", \"partial_history\": \"Data unavailable. Some counts for this layer could not be made in this update, so a zero may mean a count is missing. This is not an all-clear.\", \"radar_reason\": \"radar: {detail}\", \"reports_failed\": \"\\u003cstrong\\u003eStorm reports didn\\u0027t all load\\u003c/strong\\u003e ({detail}). \", \"reports_none\": \"No SPC storm reports in or near Montana in the last 3 days. \", \"unavailable\": \"Data unavailable\", \"waiting\": \"Turn on Points of interest to show these.\"}</script>\n",
